  text:
    en: Where do you go on Saturday morning to fight for a promotion on fresh meat?
    native: "Gdzie idziesz w sobotni poranek walczy\u0107 o promocj\u0119 na \u015Bwie\u017Ce
      mi\u0119so?"
  visual: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 742c72cc618ada44aaa7577d148ea607, type: 3}
  useImageAnswers: 0
  answers:
  - text:
      en: Biedronka
      native: Biedronka
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 1
  - text:
      en: Lidl
      native: Lidl
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Bazaar
      native: Targowisko
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: "\u017Babka"
      native: "\u017Babka"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  explanation:
    en: Biedronka is the most popular supermarket. 'Paleta' blocking the aisle is
      a national symbol.
    native: "Biedronka to najpopularniejszy supermarket. Paleta blokuj\u0105ca alejk\u0119
      to symbol narodowy."
